   "text": "设 \\(z=z(x,y)\\) 由 \\(\\begin{cases}x=ue^{v},\\\\ y=uv,\\\\ z=v,\\end{cases}(u>0,\\ v>1)\\) 确定，则 \\(\\frac{\\partial^{2}z}{\\partial x\\partial y}=\\)（　）\nA. \\(\\frac{xy}{z(1-z)^{3}}\\)\nB. \\(\\frac{xy}{z(z-1)^{3}}\\)\nC. \\(\\frac{z}{xy(1-z)^{3}}\\)\nD. \\(\\frac{z}{xy(z-1)^{3}}\\)",
   "answer": "D",
   "steps": [
    "由 \\(z=v\\) 得 \\(x=ue^{z}\\)，\\(y=uz\\)，消去 \\(u\\)：\\(u=\\frac{y}{z}\\)，故 \\(x=\\frac{y}{z}e^{z}\\)，即 \\(F(x,y,z)=x-\\frac{y}{z}e^{z}=0\\)。",
    "求偏导：\\(F_{x}=1\\)，\\(F_{y}=-\\frac{e^{z}}{z}\\)，\\(F_{z}=-y\\cdot\\frac{e^{z}(z-1)}{z^{2}}\\)。",
    "\\(z_{x}=-\\frac{F_{x}}{F_{z}}=-\\frac{1}{-\\frac{ye^{z}(z-1)}{z^{2}}}=\\frac{z^{2}}{ye^{z}(z-1)}\\)。由 \\(ye^{z}=xz\\) 得 \\(z_{x}=\\frac{z}{x(z-1)}\\)。",
    "\\(z_{y}=-\\frac{F_{y}}{F_{z}}=-\\frac{-\\frac{e^{z}}{z}}{-\\frac{ye^{z}(z-1)}{z^{2}}}=-\\frac{z}{y(z-1)}\\)。",
    "\\(z_{xy}=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\left[\\frac{z}{x(z-1)}\\right]=\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot\\frac{z_{y}(z-1)-zz_{y}}{(z-1)^{2}}=-\\frac{z_{y}}{x(z-1)^{2}}\\)。",
    "代入 \\(z_{y}=-\\frac{z}{y(z-1)}\\) 得 \\(z_{xy}=\\frac{z}{xy(z-1)^{3}}\\)。",
    "故选 D。"
   ],
