    "由 \\((\\lambda_{1}-\\lambda_{2})^{2}\\geqslant0\\) 展开得 \\((\\lambda_{1}+\\lambda_{2})^{2}\\geqslant4\\lambda_{1}\\lambda_{2}\\)。",
