    "\\(a=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}x\\left[\\frac{(1+\\frac{1}{x})^{x}}{e}-1\\right]\\)。令 \\(t=\\frac{1}{x}\\)，\\(a=\\frac{1}{e}\\lim_{t\\to0^{+}}\\frac{e^{\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}-1}-1}{t}\\)。",
    "由 \\(\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}-1=-\\frac{t}{2}+\\frac{t^{2}}{3}+o(t^{2})\\) 得 \\(e^{\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}-1}-1=-\\frac{t}{2}+O(t^{2})\\)，故 \\(a=\\frac{1}{e}\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{2}\\)。",
    "\\(b=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\left[\\frac{(1+\\frac{1}{x})^{x}}{e}-1\\right]x^{2}+\\frac{x}{2}\\)。",
    "继续展开：\\(e^{\\frac{\\ln(1+t)}{t}-1}=1-\\frac{t}{2}+\\left(\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{1}{8}\\right)t^{2}+o(t^{2})=1-\\frac{t}{2}+\\frac{11}{24}t^{2}+o(t^{2})\\)。",
    "于是 \\(y=x^{2}\\left[-\\frac{1}{2x}+\\frac{11}{24x^{2}}+o(x^{-2})\\right]=-\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{11}{24}+o(1)\\)。",
    "所以 \\(b=\\frac{11}{24}\\)，斜渐近线为 \\(y=-\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{11}{24}\\)。"
